        <p class="govuk-body">You can email the Ofgem team at <a class="govuk-link" href=mailto:laflex.enquiry@ofgem.gov.uk class="govuk-link">laflex.enquiry@ofgem.gov.uk</a> if you need help using the external service. We'll reply to your email as soon as possible. </p>    
